# Copy this file to .env.local (gitignored) for local development.
#
# NEXT_PUBLIC_YOUTUBE_API_KEY — powers the live "Community" video row on
# /trainers (components/signature/CommunityVideos.tsx, lib/youtube.ts).
# Create one at https://console.cloud.google.com: enable "YouTube Data API
# v3", create an API key, and restrict it (Application restrictions →
# HTTP referrers) to:
#   http://localhost:3000/*
#   https://mustafaisonline.github.io/Portal4TrainingCertification/*
# Restrict it further (API restrictions) to "YouTube Data API v3" only.
#
# In production (GitHub Pages), this is supplied by the deploy workflow
# from the repo secret YOUTUBE_API_KEY — see
# .github/workflows/deploy-pages.yml. Set that secret at:
# Settings → Secrets and variables → Actions → New repository secret.
#
# NEXT_PUBLIC_ prefix is required for a client-fetched value in a static
# export — see lib/youtube.ts's header comment for why this is safe here.
NEXT_PUBLIC_YOUTUBE_API_KEY=
